  "title": "Quick Energizing Turkish Yellow Split Peas Kisir",
  "description": "A yeasty and crispy Turkish dish featuring yellow split peas, this kisir is a high-protein friendly option for a quick snack or lunch. It is made with katsuramuki-cut vegetables for added crunch.",
