  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the yellow split peas and soak them in water for 30 minutes.",
    "Drain and chop the onion and carrot into katsuramuki-cut pieces.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a pan over medium heat and saute the onion and carrot until they are tender.",
    "Add the tomato paste, pomegranate molasses, salt, black pepper, and dried mint to the pan and stir well.",
    "Add the soaked and drained yellow split peas to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for 10 minutes or until the peas are tender.",
    "Stir in the yeast and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the kisir hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
